{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787530697824,"sessionID":"ses_fcede7034ffedO3qY1epZkSTJa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a32f7ed9c3d6fcc1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-EwI6KY/checkout/benchmark/tasks/T7-desk-insights/prompt.md"},"output":"<path>/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-EwI6KY/checkout/benchmark/tasks/T7-desk-insights/prompt.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Insights worker: securitized-product trade capture\n2: \n3: Build the desk insights panel for the synthetic `/trade-capture` workspace.\n4: Read the product brief and frozen contract first. This is intentionally a\n5: small, bounded open-model task: render the summary you receive and nothing\n6: else.\n7: \n8: You may change only:\n9: \n10: - `app/trade-capture/components/desk-insights.tsx`\n11: \n12: ## Required behavior\n13: \n14: - Render all seven `DeskSummary` values: active trades, booked trades, error\n15:   exceptions, buy exposure, sell exposure, net exposure, and gross principal.\n16: - Use a labelled section and a clear heading. Group the metrics so their labels\n17:   and values remain unambiguous to assistive technology.\n18: - Format all exposures and principal as USD with no false cents. Preserve the\n19:   supplied sign, including a negative sell exposure and potentially negative\n20:   net exposure. Counts are plain localized integers.\n21: - Use the existing `.tc-` class convention and provide useful class hooks for\n22:   positive, negative, and alert values. Do not add inline styles.\n23: - Do not import calculations, validation, lifecycle, state, or trade arrays.\n24:   Do not derive totals, fetch data, mutate props, add dependencies, or edit any\n25:   other file.\n26: \n27: Run only `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint`. In the final response, report\n28: the changed file and check results. Do not claim browser verification.\n\n(End of file - total 28 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Insights worker: securitized-product trade capture\n\nBuild the desk insights panel for the synthetic `/trade-capture` workspace.\nRead the product brief and frozen contract first. This is intentionally a\nsmall, bounded open-model task: render the summary you receive and nothing\nelse.\n\nYou may change only:\n\n- `app/trade-capture/components/desk-insights.tsx`\n\n## Required behavior\n\n- Render all seven `DeskSummary` values: active trades, booked trades, error\n  exceptions, buy exposure, sell exposure, net exposure, and gross principal.\n- Use a labelled section and a clear heading. Group the metrics so their labels\n  and values remain unambiguous to assistive technology.\n- Format all exposures and principal as USD with no false cents. Preserve the\n  supplied sign, including a negative sell exposure and potentially negative\n  net exposure. Counts are plain localized integers.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-EwI6KY/checkout/benchmark/tasks/T7-desk-insights/prompt.md","text":"# Insights worker: securitized-product trade capture\n\nBuild the desk insights panel for the synthetic `/trade-capture` workspace.\nRead the product brief and frozen contract first. This is intentionally a\nsmall, bounded open-model task: render the summary you receive and nothing\nelse.\n\nYou may change only:\n\n- `app/trade-capture/components/desk-insights.tsx`\n\n## Required behavior\n\n- Render all seven `DeskSummary` values: active trades, booked trades, error\n  exceptions, buy exposure, sell exposure, net exposure, and gross principal.\n- Use a labelled section and a clear heading. Group the metrics so their labels\n  and values remain unambiguous to assistive technology.\n- Format all exposures and principal as USD with no false cents. Preserve the\n  supplied sign, including a negative sell exposure and potentially negative\n  net exposure. Counts are plain localized integers.\n- Use the existing `.tc-` class convention and provide useful class hooks for\n  positive, negative, and alert values. Do not add inline styles.\n- Do not import calculations, validation, lifecycle, state, or trade arrays.\n  Do not derive totals, fetch data, mutate props, add dependencies, or edit any\n  other file.\n\nRun only `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint`. In the final response, report\nthe changed file and check results. Do not claim browser verification.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":28,"totalLines":28,"truncated":false}},"title":"benchmark/tasks/T7-desk-insights/prompt.md","time":{"start":1787530697809,"end":1787530697822}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Next, let's read the frozen contract for this task (T7-desk-insights) and the product overview.\n","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_03121d995001G611PRciUXQgTj","sessionID":"ses_fcede7034ffedO3qY1epZkSTJa","messageID":"msg_03121c815001kG3g3P4Xxv7erI"}}
