{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787530836454,"sessionID":"ses_fcede7034ffedO3qY1epZkSTJa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-946b94ae7485618f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-EwI6KY/checkout/app/trade-capture/components/desk-insights.tsx","content":"import type { DeskInsightsProps } from \"../domain/types.ts\";\n\nfunction formatUsd(value: number): string {\n  return value.toLocaleString(\"en-US\", {\n    style: \"currency\",\n    currency: \"USD\",\n    maximumFractionDigits: 0,\n  });\n}\n\nfunction formatCount(value: number): string {\n  return value.toLocaleString(\"en-US\");\n}\n\nfunction toneClass(value: number): string {\n  if (value > 0) return \"tc-positive\";\n  if (value < 0) return \"tc-negative\";\n  return \"tc-neutral\";\n}\n\nexport function DeskInsights({ summary }: DeskInsightsProps) {\n  const {\n    activeTradeCount,\n    bookedTradeCount,\n    exceptionCount,\n    buyExposure,\n    sellExposure,\n    netExposure,\n    grossPrincipal,\n  } = summary;\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"tc-panel tc-insights\" aria-labelledby=\"tc-insights-title\">\n      <div className=\"tc-panel-heading\">\n        <p className=\"tc-eyebrow\">Desk view</p>\n        <h2 id=\"tc-insights-title\">Today&apos;s position</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"tc-metric-group\" aria-labelledby=\"tc-insights-activity-title\">\n        <h3 id=\"tc-insights-activity-title\" className=\"tc-metric-group-title\">Activity</h3>\n        <dl className=\"tc-metric-grid\">\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Active trades</dt>\n            <dd className=\"tc-metric-value\">{formatCount(activeTradeCount)}</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Booked trades</dt>\n            <dd className=\"tc-metric-value\">{formatCount(bookedTradeCount)}</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Error exceptions</dt>\n            <dd className={`tc-metric-value ${exceptionCount > 0 ? \"tc-alert\" : \"tc-neutral\"}`}>{formatCount(exceptionCount)}</dd>\n          </div>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"tc-metric-group\" aria-labelledby=\"tc-insights-exposure-title\">\n        <h3 id=\"tc-insights-exposure-title\" className=\"tc-metric-group-title\">Exposure</h3>\n        <dl className=\"tc-metric-grid\">\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Buy exposure</dt>\n            <dd className={`tc-metric-value ${toneClass(buyExposure)}`}>{formatUsd(buyExposure)}</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Sell exposure</dt>\n            <dd className={`tc-metric-value ${toneClass(sellExposure)}`}>{formatUsd(sellExposure)}</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Net exposure</dt>\n            <dd className={`tc-metric-value ${toneClass(netExposure)}`}>{formatUsd(netExposure)}</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"tc-metric\">\n            <dt className=\"tc-metric-label\">Gross principal</dt>\n            <dd className=\"tc-metric-value\">{formatUsd(grossPrincipal)}</dd>\n          </div>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-EwI6KY/checkout/app/trade-capture/components/desk-insights.tsx","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"app/trade-capture/components/desk-insights.tsx","time":{"start":1787530836441,"end":1787530836452}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let's calculate the seed values:\n\n- Trade 001 (booked, buy): face 1,000,000 × 0.95 = 950,000; gross = 950,000 × 99.25 / 100 = 942,875. Buy.\n- Trade 002 (booked, sell): face 820,000; gross = 820,000 × 101.1 / 100 = 829,020. Sell → -829,020.\n- Trade 003: cancelled, excluded.\n- Trade 004 (validated, sell): face 910,000; gross = 910,000 × 100.2 / 100 = 911,820. Sell → -911,820.\n- Trade 005 (draft, buy): face 880,000; gross = 880,000 × 97.75 / 100 = 860,200. Buy.\n- Trade 006 (booked, sell): face 1,000,000 × 1 = 1,000,000; gross = 1,000,000 × 102.35 / 100 = 1,023,500. Sell → -1,023,500.\n\nActive = 001, 002, 004, 005, 006 (5 trades).\n- activeTradeCount = 5\n- bookedTradeCount = 3 (001, 002, 006)\n- exceptionCount: errors. Trade 004 (ABS, weighted-average-price is valid, agency \"\" — ABS doesn't require agency; pool required? Specified pool only. Looks valid → probably 0 errors, or maybe warnings). Trade 005 (CLO draft, clientTradeId \"\" → error \"missing-client-trade-id\"). Trade 006 (TBA, dollar-roll is valid for TBA, poolNumber \"\" → error \"required-pool\"). So exceptions ≈ 2.\n- buyExposure = 942,875 + 860,200 = 1,803,075\n- sellExposure = -(829,020 + 911,820 + 1,023,500) = -2,764,340\n- netExposure = 1,803,075 - 2,764,340 = -961,265 (negative!)\n- grossPrincipal = 1,803,075 + 2,764,340 = 4,567,415\n\nAll integer dollar amounts. So `maximumFractionDigits: 0` is safe with the seed, and \"no fake cents\" is satisfied. Even if values had cents, maximumFractionDigits: 0 would round — but the product says values are formatted, so to be safest against \"no meaning change,\" we could keep maxFractionDigits at 0 per the requirement (\"no fake cents\" strongly suggests 0 digits). The requirement explicitly states \"format all exposures and principal as USD without fake cents\" — that's `maximumFractionDigits: 0`. Going with this.\n\nSign preservation: Intl's currency formatting for negatives in en-US renders as \"−$2,764,340\" (U+2212 minus). Sign preserved. Good.\n\nZero: renders as \"$0\" — no sign issue.\n\nNow, class hooks: \"provide useful class hooks for positive, negative, and alert values.\"\n- Positive: `tc-positive`\n- Negative: `tc-negative`\n- Alert: `tc-alert` on error exceptions when > 0.\n\nWhich values get positive/negative hooks? Exposures: buyExposure (positive → tc-positive), sellExposure (negative → tc-negative), netExposure (sign-dependent → tc-positive/tc-negative/tc-neutral). Gross principal is always non-negative — could also use exposureClass, or just plain. I'll compute the tone class for all three exposure metrics, and leave gross principal as a plain `tc-metric-value` (since it's a magnitude, not a directional value). Actually, for consistency, applying tc-positive to gross principal could be misleading; plain is better.\n\nFor zero net exposure, use `tc-neutral`.\n\nNow, the existing CSS has `.tc-metric-grid` (flex wrap). I'll add `tc-metric`, `tc-metric-label`, `tc-metric-value`, `tc-metric-group`, `tc-metric-group-title`, `tc-positive`, `tc-negative`, `tc-alert`, `tc-neutral` classes — these don't exist in the CSS, but the task says \"use existing .tc- class conventions and provide useful class hooks\" — providing hooks means including class names in markup; styling is the visual system worker's job (Kimi K3 owns the visual system). Must not edit CSS (other files are out of scope).\n\nHeading id uniqueness: existing ids are `tc-insights-title` — keep this. For group headings, use h3 with ids `tc-insights-activity-title` and `tc-insights-exposure-title`.\n\nWait — do we need role=\"group\" on divs? divs with aria-labelledby are fine; role=\"group\" is optional. Keep it simple: `<div className=\"tc-metric-group\" aria-labelledby=\"...\">`.\n\nActually, do the h3s need to be inside the dl? No, structure is:\n\n```\n<div className=\"tc-metric-group\" aria-labelledby=\"tc-insights-activity-title\">\n  <h3 id=\"tc-insights-activity-title\" className=\"tc-metric-group-title\">Activity</h3>\n  <dl className=\"tc-metric-grid\">\n    ...\n  </dl>\n</div>\n```\n\nThis is valid and unambiguous: each group is labelled, and each dt/dd pair is adjacent.\n\nCount formatting: \"counts are plain localized integers\" → `toLocaleString(\"en-US\")` or Intl.NumberFormat with maximumFractionDigits: 0. I'll use toLocaleString(\"en-US\") for counts (matches existing code style at line 12: `summary.netExposure.toLocaleString(\"en-US\")`).\n\nHmm, but for USD I want to use Intl.NumberFormat with currency. I'll define a module-level `formatUsd` helper. Module-level constant is fine.\n\nActually, to minimize code and follow the existing inline style (inline toLocaleString), I could do:\n\n```ts\nfunction formatUsd(value: number): string {\n  return value.toLocaleString(\"en-US\", {\n    style: \"currency\",\n    currency: \"USD\",\n    maximumFractionDigits: 0,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n`toLocaleString` with options — simple, no module-level Intl instance needed. Good.\n\nNote: negative values via toLocaleString currency en-US: \"(...)\"? No — en-US uses \"-$x\" (in ICU it's actually U+2212). Either way, sign is preserved.\n\nLet me write the final component. Labels (accurate labels for metrics):\n- \"Active trades\" → activeTradeCount\n- \"Booked trades\" → bookedTradeCount\n- \"Error exceptions\" → exceptionCount\n- \"Buy exposure\" → buyExposure\n- \"Sell exposure\" → sellExposure\n- \"Net exposure\" → netExposure\n- \"Gross principal\" → grossPrincipal\n\nHeading: keep \"Today's position\" with the tc-eyebrow \"Desk view\". Good — the labelled section is preserved.\n\nNow writing the file.\n","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_03123c49f00173WJ0phta2FzWx","sessionID":"ses_fcede7034ffedO3qY1epZkSTJa","messageID":"msg_031232353001nCf4NvEqxVuuRC"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1787530836523,"sessionID":"ses_fcede7034ffedO3qY1epZkSTJa","part":{"id":"prt_03123befd001V4iFHNmMfptDvm","messageID":"msg_031232353001nCf4NvEqxVuuRC","sessionID":"ses_fcede7034ffedO3qY1epZkSTJa","type":"text","text":"\n\nNow I have full context. The seed data produces whole-dollar values, a negative sell exposure, and a negative net exposure. I'll rewrite the component to render all seven metrics in a labelled, grouped `dl` structure with sign-aware class hooks.\n\n","time":{"start":1787530821373,"end":1787530836519}}}
